'''Chroma Elderwood Blade''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It has a jagged tanto-shaped blade that is dark green in color with a cracked texture over it. The edge of the blade is a color alternating texture, and chromatic colored streaks can be seen along the spine. The guard and handle, resembling a tree branch, are purple in color and are connected together. Part of the guard curls onto the spine of the blade, and the other part droops in front of the handle.

==Trivia==
*It was a victim of mass duping causing it to lose a lot of its value
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Elderwood Blade]], which was found in the same box.
*It is the fifth ever holiday chroma and the third Halloween chroma to be released inside the game, the others being [[Chroma Evergreen]], [[Chroma Evergun]], [[Chroma Traveler's Gun]], [[Chroma Swirly Gun]], [[Chroma Candleflame]], [[Chroma Boneblade]], and [[Chroma Gingerblade]]. The same year, [[Chroma Cookiecane]] was released. 
* Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

